{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D \u00d7 Open World \u00d7 Roguelike \u00d7 Monster Collecting!</strong><br>Embark on an epic journey through a <strong>procedurally generated 2D world</strong> where you capture, train, and evolve your monsters. Use <strong>random fusion and endless combinations</strong> to forge a one-of-a-kind team, unlocking rare evolutions and surprising hybrids along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes and uncover hidden shrines, with each run offering new challenges and rewards. Choose your own playstyle \u2014 dive into random events and thrilling battles, or relax by gathering resources, managing your farm, and cooking meals to prepare for the next adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>3v3 strategic turn-based combat</strong>, customize skill loadouts, and craft your unique battle style. Every run, every fight, and every fusion writes a new story \u2014 can you collect them all and conquer this ever-changing world?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960080?t=1773057406","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960080?t=1773057406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960080/1ff10e1ed0b8c53ffbbfd894e1d5ff33bcaf34ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773057406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960080/1ff10e1ed0b8c53ffbbfd894e1d5ff33bcaf34ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773057406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D \u00d7 Open World \u00d7 Roguelike \u00d7 Monster Collecting!</strong><br>Embark on an epic journey through a <strong>procedurally generated 2D world</strong> where you capture, train, and evolve your monsters. Use <strong>random fusion and endless combinations</strong> to forge a one-of-a-kind team, unlocking rare evolutions and surprising hybrids along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes and uncover hidden shrines, with each run offering new challenges and rewards. Choose your own playstyle \u2014 dive into random events and thrilling battles, or relax by gathering resources, managing your farm, and cooking meals to prepare for the next adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>3v3 strategic turn-based combat</strong>, customize skill loadouts, and craft your unique battle style. Every run, every fight, and every fusion writes a new story \u2014 can you collect them all and conquer this ever-changing world?</p>","developers":["chengyou"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960080/7a7fc7d8baa69db0ab2b2708dc4dc51db091bd67/header.jpg?t=1773057406","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960080/1206392118/50b5ac2f9854791c51d62a8aff3f200c74492a52/1758958199/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773057404","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960080/1206392118/50b5ac2f9854791c51d62a8aff3f200c74492a52/1758958199/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773057404","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960080/1206392118